#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now: the mod's DLAA / DLSS work costs nothing."
msgstr "Сейчас выкл: DLAA / DLSS мода ничего не стоят."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The whole mod costs %ls per frame now; off saves most of it."
msgstr "Весь мод сейчас стоит %ls на кадр; выкл убирает большую часть."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs nothing itself; watch the perf lines for what it saves."
msgstr "Сам ничего не стоит; смотрите строки perf, сколько он экономит."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now."
msgstr "Сейчас выкл."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls per frame now (GPU per eye: 1 (K) 1.0, 2 (E) / 3 (F) 0.6, 4 (M) ~3 ms)."
msgstr "Сейчас стоит %ls на кадр (GPU на глаз: 1 (K) 1.0, 2 (E) / 3 (F) 0.6, 4 (M) ~3 мс)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now: sharpening costs nothing."
msgstr "Сейчас выкл: резкость ничего не стоит."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls GPU per frame now; 0 saves it."
msgstr "Сейчас %ls GPU на кадр; 0 это убирает."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now (Sharpen strength is 0): sharpening costs nothing."
msgstr "Сейчас выкл (Сила резкости 0): резкость ничего не стоит."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Same pass as Sharpen strength: costs %ls ms GPU per frame now."
msgstr "Тот же проход, что Сила резкости: сейчас %ls мс GPU на кадр."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "CPU %ls ms per frame now (the sampler swaps)."
msgstr "Сейчас CPU %ls мс на кадр (смена сэмплера)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed in flat: flat mode always uses the whole picture."
msgstr "Серо в плоском режиме: он всегда использует всю картинку."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now: DLAA/DLSS costs nothing."
msgstr "Сейчас выкл: DLAA/DLSS ничего не стоит."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "DLAA costs %ls per frame at %d %%; a smaller area costs less."
msgstr "DLAA стоит %ls на кадр при %d %%; меньшая область дешевле."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Off now: costs nothing."
msgstr "Сейчас выкл: ничего не стоит."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls per frame now; the profiles medium / low cut it."
msgstr "Сейчас стоит %ls на кадр; профили средний / низкий это снижают."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls per frame now; fewer mirrors cost less."
msgstr "Сейчас стоит %ls на кадр; меньше зеркал = дешевле."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed: Smooth mirrors is off."
msgstr "Серо: плавные зеркала выкл."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Always on: dlaa.ini mirror mode 3 is in turns already."
msgstr "Всегда вкл: режим зеркал 3 в dlaa.ini уже «по очереди»."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The mirrors cost %ls per frame now."
msgstr "Зеркала сейчас стоят %ls на кадр."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed: only for AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D)."
msgstr "Серо: только для процессоров AMD X3D с двумя группами ядер (7950X3D, 9950X3D)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "On now: the game runs only on the cores with the big cache."
msgstr "Сейчас вкл: игра работает только на ядрах с большим кэшем."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "On, but not applied: the game's cores were already limited (see the log)."
msgstr "Вкл, но не применено: ядра игры уже были ограничены (см. лог)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed in VR: VR always runs DLAA on the finished picture."
msgstr "Серо в VR: VR всегда применяет DLAA к готовой картинке."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Greyed: VR only."
msgstr "Серо: только VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Greyed: the game's console is off. Set g_developer and g_console to \"1\" in config.cfg while the "
"game is closed."
msgstr ""
"Серо: консоль игры выключена. Задайте g_developer и g_console равными \"1\" в config.cfg при "
"закрытой игре."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Waiting: click the game window on the desktop. The mod types into the game's console only while "
"the game window has the focus."
msgstr ""
"Ожидание: щёлкните окно игры на рабочем столе. Мод вводит текст в консоль игры, только пока окно "
"игры в фокусе."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Sending to the game's console..."
msgstr "Отправка в консоль игры..."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's log did not confirm the last change: see the mod's log."
msgstr "Лог игры не подтвердил последнее изменение: см. лог мода."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Mix and split need the game's TAA: set Anti-aliasing to TAA in the game's graphics settings."
msgstr "Микс и разделение требуют TAA игры: поставьте сглаживание на TAA в настройках графики игры."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's TAA is not running now: the mod runs alone."
msgstr "TAA игры сейчас не работает: мод работает один."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's TAA is running now: set the game's Anti-aliasing to Disabled, or set Mode to Mix."
msgstr ""
"TAA игры сейчас работает: поставьте сглаживание игры на Отключено или поставьте Режим на Микс."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's TAA is running now: split is on."
msgstr "TAA игры сейчас работает: разделение включено."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The game's TAA is running now: the mix is on."
msgstr "TAA игры сейчас работает: микс включён."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: its TAA pass did not run in this frame."
msgstr "Возврат к TAA игры: его проход TAA не выполнялся в этом кадре."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: the game's jitter could not be read (see the log)."
msgstr "Возврат к TAA игры: не удалось прочитать джиттер игры (см. лог)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: the picture before the game's TAA was not found."
msgstr "Возврат к TAA игры: изображение до TAA игры не найдено."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: mix and split do not work with Windows HDR."
msgstr "Возврат к TAA игры: микс и разделение не работают с Windows HDR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: DLAA is off."
msgstr "Возврат к TAA игры: DLAA выкл."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: the game's tonemap was not found (see the log)."
msgstr "Возврат к TAA игры: тонмаппинг игры не найден (см. лог)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Fell back to the game's TAA: DLAA did not run on this frame (see the log)."
msgstr "Возврат к TAA игры: DLAA не выполнялся в этом кадре (см. лог)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Or turn on the game console (g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg): then the mod switches it "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"Или включите консоль игры (g_developer и g_console 1 в config.cfg): тогда мод переключит это за "
"вас."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid "Turn on the game console to let the mod switch the game's Anti-aliasing."
msgstr "Включите консоль игры, чтобы мод мог переключать сглаживание игры."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid "TAA"
msgstr "TAA"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
